  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kids Operating Room - Field Readiness Hub</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project involves establishing a fully functional Field Readiness Hub to serve as the central technical and operational platform for humanitarian health interventions. The Hub provides facilities for testing, validation, and simulation of modular emergency healthcare systems, offers engineering, clinical, and logistical support, and acts as a training and capacity-building center for personnel involved in emergency deployments. It will also play catalytic role in enabling the establishment of a rapidly deployable emergency hospital in the West Bank (and when circumstances allow, Gaza), led by Palestinian healthcare professionals, to deliver critical medical services.</narrative>
  </description>
